<p>Fires a wave of projectiles in a radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 5, 6, 6, 7</acronym> cone, dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">105%, 120%, 131%, 141%, 150%</acronym> weapon damage. All targets struck by this will be knocked back to the maximum range of the cone and stunned for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 4</acronym> turns.</p><p>Each target struck has a 20% chance to be marked.</p><p>The chance to knockback and stun increases with your Accuracy.</p>